# The demo bundle is built by scripts/build-demo-bundle.sh during the docs
# workflow, not committed. Only data/ (captured by scripts/capture-demo-data.sh)
# is tracked, because it is the demo's input rather than a build output.
#
# inputs/ holds the one scan input that a name alone does not reproduce: the
# supplier SBOM the demo analyzes arrives as an uploaded file. Every other
# published scan is reachable from an identifier — a path in examples/, an image
# tag, a model id, a firmware URL — so the capture workflow can re-run them all.
*
!.gitignore
!data/
!data/**
!inputs/
!inputs/**
